# ── Provisioning ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@Given "^a '([^']*)' trade pending amendment approval is created via api$"
    Given a live '$1' trade is created via api
    When maker has valid data for Trade Amendment
    And performs the Trade Amendment action via api
    Then response status code is '200'

@Given "^a live '([^']*)' trade with a pending Amendment exists$"
    Given a live '$1' trade is created via api
    Given build json request with path parameter 'tradeId' from stored variable 'createdTradeId' as user 'maker@example.com'
    And set request body from test data 'trade-amendment'
    When post to path '/trades/{tradeId}/update'
    Then response status code is '200'
    And store response field 'msg' as 'amendTaskMsg'
    And the amendment task ID is extracted and stored

# ── Build request ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

@When "^maker has valid data for Trade Amendment$"
    Given build json request with path parameter 'tradeId' from stored variable 'createdTradeId' as user 'maker@example.com'
    And set request body from current scenario

@When "^checker has valid data for amendment approval$"
    Given build json request with path parameter 'taskId' from stored variable 'createdAmendTaskId' as user 'checker@example.com'

@When "^checker has valid data for amendment rejection$"
    Given build json request with path parameter 'taskId' from stored variable 'createdAmendTaskId' as user 'checker@example.com'

@When "^maker has valid data for amendment approval$"
    Given build json request with path parameter 'taskId' from stored variable 'createdAmendTaskId' as user 'maker@example.com'

# ── Make api call ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

@When "^performs the Trade Amendment action via api$"
    When post to path '/trades/{tradeId}/update'
    And attach the response body to the report

# ── Assertions ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@Then "^the trade amendment enters Pending Approval status$"
    Then response matches current scenario

@Then "^the trade is updated with the amended terms$"
    Then the 'trade' should be 'updated' successfully

# Stores the task ID extracted from the msg field for downstream checker steps.
@Then "^the '([^']*)' trade should be updated with the amended terms$"
    Then response matches current scenario
    And store response field 'msg' as 'amendTaskMsg'
    And the amendment task ID is extracted and stored

@Then "^the amended fields are persisted on the trade$"
    Then response matches current scenario

@Then "^the Trade Amendment request is rejected with a business rule violation$"
    Then failed to 'update' 'trade' with status '409'

@Then "^the Amendment request is rejected with a conflict$"
    Then failed to 'update' 'trade' with status '409'

@Then "^the amendment self-approval request is rejected with permission denied$"
    Then failed to 'approve' 'amendment' with status '403'

@Then "^the original trade fields are preserved after amendment rejection$"
    Then response matches current scenario
